##grflangid 0x01
STR_GRF_NAME :NextGRF
STR_GRF_DESC :NextGRF 0.4.0: 253 default-brand vehicles, 1700-2050. Finite ranges for all default and NextGRF aircraft; shorter jets and 1000-1600 tile long-haul airliners. Eight rail wagon generations, ships, buses and trucks. Default aircraft changes are limited to range.
STR_ENGINE_POOL :NextGRF requires the multiple NewGRF vehicle sets setting (dynamic engines).
